---
import HsmMapLegend from './HsmMapLegend.astro';
---

<figure class="hsm-figure">
  <div class="hsm-figure__chrome">
    <p class="hsm-figure__eyebrow">FIG. 02</p>
    <p class="hsm-figure__title">Why recording bias matters</p>
    <p class="hsm-figure__lede">
      Background locations follow where bats have been recorded at all, so the model compares habitat where people are likely to have looked.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="hsm-figure__frame hsm-bias">
    <div class="hsm-bias__step">
      <p class="hsm-bias__num">1</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__label">Uneven recording</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__meta">South Yorkshire crop · aggregated intensity</p>
      <img
        src="/images/hsm/panel-bias-obs.png"
        alt="Cropped map showing clustered bat recording intensity around towns and accessible sites."
        width="800"
        height="700"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="hsm-bias__step">
      <p class="hsm-bias__num">2</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__label">Effort proxy</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__meta">All-species presence · σ = 6.5 cells</p>
      <img
        src="/images/hsm/panel-bias-effort.png"
        alt="Cropped map of a smoothed survey-effort surface derived from all bat records."
        width="800"
        height="700"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="hsm-bias__step">
      <p class="hsm-bias__num">3</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__label">Background sample</p>
      <p class="hsm-bias__meta">Illustrative subsample · contrast floor 0.025</p>
      <img
        src="/images/hsm/panel-bias-background.png"
        alt="Cropped effort surface with a subsample of background sample points denser where recording effort is higher."
        width="800"
        height="700"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hsm-bias__legend-row">
    <HsmMapLegend kind="intensity" label="Effort / intensity" />
    <p class="hsm-bias__swatch"><span class="hsm-bias__dot"></span> Background points (not bat observations)</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="hsm-figure__caption">
    Methodology matches the live training defaults (<code>surface=all_bat</code>, contrast floor 0.025, σ = 6.5).
    Panel 3 shows a random subsample of background locations for illustration — not presence records, and not the full training draw.
    This does not remove survey bias; it asks a more useful question given uneven effort.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .hsm-figure {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .hsm-figure__chrome {
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .hsm-figure__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
    color: var(--colour-rust);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .hsm-figure__title {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .hsm-figure__lede {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--colour-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .hsm-figure__frame {
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-rule);
    background: #f7f4ec;
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__step {
    min-width: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__num {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--colour-moss);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .hsm-bias__label {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .hsm-bias__meta {
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
    color: var(--colour-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__step img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-rule);
  }

  .hsm-bias__legend-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__swatch {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--colour-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .hsm-bias__dot {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--colour-rust);
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .hsm-figure__caption {
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--colour-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .hsm-figure__caption code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hsm-bias {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
